    commentIndustry: "Mature-to-contracting core across SA/UK/Australia in FY26; TFG outgrew the SA market in most months. Digital is the only structurally growing layer (group e-commerce 14.8% of turnover; Bash - SA's #1 fashion app - profitable two years early, >R3bn turnover). Leading category positions (home ~64% internal, sport 30%+). Base revenue CAGR ~5% (segment-built).",
